Z||000000||stimpy||06-20-2001||12:32 PM||||<BR>Just got back from getting an estimate on getting my gold GT painted. I picked 2001 Chrysler Champagne Pearl, which is a very close match to the faded part of my original gold paint. I've always thought that silvery gold color looks very classy.  I'm pondering going monochrome (88 style) with the paint.<P>I do want a little pizazz with it, so I think I want to do a little something with color-shifting paint. I'm thinking either a racing stripe or painting the black trim strip with a gold/burgandy paint. Any opinions?<P>Also, tomorrow I get my AC done! Yea! And just in time. It was 103 degrees yesterday with something like 80% humidity. Yech!<P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||10
